{
    "name": "riso",
    "note": "Riso, the wildcard: a risograph print. Every other pair is an editor theme of greys with a pastel or neon accent; this one is ink on stock. Light: uncoated white paper, the text in Medium Blue ink, Fluorescent Pink as the accent, and the rest of the risograph ink list for the hues (Riso Green, Orange, Sunflower, Scarlet, Teal, Blue, Purple). Dark: the same inks printed on deep burgundy stock, the paper colour as the text. The colours are the published Riso ink approximations, darkened where text must read on paper. Group tabs: the tab is the orange, a locked group's tab Riso Blue. VS Code has no riso theme: Rosé Pine Dawn / Moon (mvllow.rose-pine) when installed, else Light Modern and Red (the built-in dark red).",
